<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01 · 系统主张：AI 做人类做不到的事</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 20, paddingBottom: 16, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    系统的价值不在于把教师做过的事做得更便宜，而在于补足教师<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>本来做不到</span>的诊断工作。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>步骤级</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>为每道题的每一小步标出知识点、难度与错因</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>套路级</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>区分「不会这个知识」与「选错了方法」</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>整卷级</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>从一次错误升级为跨考试、跨题目的稳定模式</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, borderLeft: '4px solid #8B97A8' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    边界声明：以上为设计目标与已实现的评价框架；学习效果尚未经真实学生试用验证，本报告不作提分主张。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 330, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#9EC1F0' }}>本次汇报的核心线索</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>两次</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>升维</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FFC107' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C8DCF7', flex: 1 }}>试题 → 试卷</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FFC107' }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C8DCF7', flex: 1 }}>知识点 → 套路</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 278, height: 1, background: '#2E5CA8' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#9EC1F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                后面将论证：这两次升维产生的结论，在下层不可归约。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>04 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
